WEBVTT

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.930
Here it comes.

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:25.550
Gio...

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:27.380
You came for us?

00:00:44.740 --> 00:00:46.400
Gio...

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:54.310
Gio...

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:02.120
What on earth happened?!

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:29.280
Why?

00:01:46.270 --> 00:01:51.970
In my younger days, I lost

00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:57.850
even the reason for this pain

00:01:57.850 --> 00:02:03.550
Crouching over, making excuses

00:02:03.550 --> 00:02:06.780
I must have...

00:02:08.190 --> 00:02:14.500
Taking hold of the premonition
I saw at the end of the blue,

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:22.070
riding the wind, I'm off
to where the light shines

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:24.970
I'll always be with you

00:02:24.970 --> 00:02:27.410
see the sky in front of you

00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:31.810
fly high in a light from the deepest blue

00:02:33.580 --> 00:02:39.150
Riding the echo of swirling stars,

00:02:39.150 --> 00:02:41.820
I sing out

00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:50.490
May my voice reach you

00:03:05.880 --> 00:03:07.510
Why?

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:35.270
Stop, Gio! Don't you know who we are?!

00:03:41.480 --> 00:03:42.780
What's that?!

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:45.550
It looks like some Dragons
are fighting each other.

00:03:48.890 --> 00:03:51.120
What's come over you, Gio?!

00:04:16.180 --> 00:04:17.850
Toa!

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:29.360
Gio... Why?

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:31.170
Why are you doing this?

00:04:31.170 --> 00:04:35.000
You said you would protect Toa, didn't you?

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:40.170
You cannot save Toa.

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:42.110
Save?

00:04:43.980 --> 00:04:48.610
Toa's life will come to an end soon.

00:04:52.820 --> 00:04:56.020
What did you just say?

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:03.390
Is that true?

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:07.390
Toa!

00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:10.130
Toa...

00:05:12.310 --> 00:05:14.680
Come with me.

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:16.310
Gio...

00:05:16.310 --> 00:05:18.850
Come on.

00:05:18.850 --> 00:05:21.250
No! I won't turn over Toa to you!

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:22.910
Move.

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:31.260
No! I won't turn Toa over to someone
who would hurt everyone else!

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:36.420
No way! I won't do it! I will protect Toa!

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:45.870
Stop!

00:05:45.870 --> 00:05:49.600
Gio, I'm begging you!

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:55.580
Toa, I am the only one who can save you.

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:09.260
I am able to save you, now that
I have become Thanatos' successor.

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:14.200
Thanatos' successor?

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:21.880
What are you talking about, Gio?

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:26.810
We... promised to all live together,

00:06:26.810 --> 00:06:31.120
and protect Toa together, didn't we?

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:34.260
So now, why?

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:37.320
There is no place for me there.

00:06:42.900 --> 00:06:44.460
What?!

00:06:49.070 --> 00:06:50.770
A child?

00:06:58.510 --> 00:07:00.140
That's...

00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:07.740
Commander, over there!

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:15.820
W-What is this?

00:07:18.170 --> 00:07:19.930
Take us in closer.

00:08:17.590 --> 00:08:20.760
You protected me, Gio.

00:08:22.330 --> 00:08:25.030
Let's go, together, Toa.

00:08:29.240 --> 00:08:32.240
I can't.

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:33.900
Gio...

00:08:36.010 --> 00:08:37.910
Come back.

00:08:41.720 --> 00:08:46.780
I told you, that's not where I belong.

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:54.790
I will come again, in time.
Don't forget what I said, Jin.

00:08:59.400 --> 00:09:01.700
Jin...

00:09:01.700 --> 00:09:04.140
What did Gio say?

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:09.440
Toa's life will come to an end soon.

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:11.100
Nothing.

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:16.980
Over there.

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:27.230
It's okay, she won't do anything.

00:09:27.230 --> 00:09:30.790
Not as injured as she is right now.

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:46.680
She is the Raum.

00:09:46.680 --> 00:09:50.410
The last Original Dragon from Thanatos.

00:09:57.360 --> 00:10:00.420
Yes, it's me.

00:10:17.140 --> 00:10:19.310
Dad...

00:10:22.050 --> 00:10:24.550
- You!
- Commander Sakaki?!

00:10:24.550 --> 00:10:28.280
Huh? "Dad"? You mean...

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:37.470
Jin...

00:10:37.470 --> 00:10:39.330
Yeah.

00:10:51.980 --> 00:10:57.510
Don't worry, I haven't tried to
take any action against you yet.

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:02.720
Um, Commander,

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:05.590
I'm sure your daughter was
involved in the shuttle accident...

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:15.570
Why are you and a Dragon in the
form of your daughter together?

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:18.110
She is not my daughter.

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:19.670
She's simply a tool.

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:21.280
A tool, you say?!

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:24.680
The relationship between
Dragons and humans isn't like that!

00:11:31.350 --> 00:11:34.060
Get up.

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:36.420
- Stop dawdling around, let's go.
- Right.

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:39.120
What is Gio thinking?

00:11:45.370 --> 00:11:47.570
Where did those two go?!

00:11:47.570 --> 00:11:49.870
You don't suppose Gio got them?

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:52.270
Don't be absurd, okay?!

00:11:54.240 --> 00:11:57.310
For now, let's get away from here, too.

00:11:57.310 --> 00:12:01.550
I'm sure that Jin and Toa have fled the island.

00:12:01.550 --> 00:12:05.150
If they're safe, they're probably
headed for the rendezvous point.

00:12:05.150 --> 00:12:08.390
Well, it's for times like this that
we have the rendezvous point.

00:12:08.390 --> 00:12:11.950
In that case, let's bug out of here, right now!

00:12:24.740 --> 00:12:28.000
Toa's life will come to an end soon.

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:33.280
I've taken emergency measures.

00:12:33.280 --> 00:12:36.440
We have to hurry and get her proper care.

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:42.520
How can you keep such a straight face?!

00:12:42.520 --> 00:12:44.790
This girl is your partner, right?!

00:12:44.790 --> 00:12:46.830
How foolish.

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:49.030
Directing feeling toward a Dragon.

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:52.800
How so?! Look how hurt she is!

00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:55.770
Take her back to base,
and whatever happens, happens.

00:13:03.210 --> 00:13:06.850
Understood. Heading there now.

00:13:06.850 --> 00:13:09.280
Wait! Commander Sakaki!

00:13:13.550 --> 00:13:15.680
Are you okay?

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:22.300
You, too...

00:13:22.300 --> 00:13:26.800
I don't want to be worried over.

00:13:26.800 --> 00:13:32.210
That's how you feel too, right?

00:13:43.720 --> 00:13:45.480
They're here.

00:13:46.820 --> 00:13:48.690
Go on.

00:13:48.690 --> 00:13:50.920
I'll let you go this time.

00:13:58.070 --> 00:13:59.930
Um...

00:13:59.930 --> 00:14:01.660
What?

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:11.780
With ISDA's technology, can you
really save an injured Dragon?

00:14:13.550 --> 00:14:15.950
Why would you ask such a thing?

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:30.360
Do you think she's all right?

00:14:30.360 --> 00:14:35.640
She's a lot more exhausted than
she looks. They have to hurry.

00:14:35.640 --> 00:14:38.770
You can tell that about her?

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:42.040
We're both Dragons, after all.

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:44.310
Dragons can tell that about each other?

00:14:44.310 --> 00:14:48.870
How hurt they are, or... their life span?

00:14:51.050 --> 00:14:52.640
Jin...

00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:02.720
We should go back... to where the others are.

00:15:29.620 --> 00:15:31.490
Dad...

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:37.430
I'm right here.

00:15:53.950 --> 00:15:58.450
Ridiculous... that is a Dragon...

00:15:58.450 --> 00:16:00.610
...not my daughter...

00:16:04.290 --> 00:16:05.690
What is the meaning of this?

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:09.660
Commander Sakaki, on orders
from headquarters, we are taking you

00:16:09.660 --> 00:16:13.530
and this anti-Thanatos factor
compatible specimen into custody.

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:29.210
Run!

00:16:31.850 --> 00:16:34.180
Run, Dad!

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:42.760
Laura!

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:47.100
Commander Sakaki has escaped!

00:16:47.100 --> 00:16:49.660
Call the search craft, on the double!

00:17:00.210 --> 00:17:04.790
You're awfully late, aren't you?
We got tired of waiting for you.

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:07.350
We're sorry to make you worry about us.

00:17:07.350 --> 00:17:10.060
Are either of you hurt?

00:17:10.060 --> 00:17:14.460
We're fine. Right, Jin?

00:17:14.460 --> 00:17:16.900
Yeah.

00:17:16.900 --> 00:17:20.400
Did something happen?

00:17:20.400 --> 00:17:23.240
Not really.

00:17:23.240 --> 00:17:26.440
Somebody tell me, what is
that bastard Gio thinking?!

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:29.440
We don't know, and don't shout!

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:31.540
But why so suddenly?

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:35.980
Jin, do you know something?

00:17:39.050 --> 00:17:43.820
Gio... said that he had
become Thanatos' successor.

00:17:46.230 --> 00:17:48.760
He said what?!

00:17:48.760 --> 00:17:52.470
Thanatos' successor?

00:17:52.470 --> 00:17:56.340
But I thought Thanatos was trying to
exterminate all contaminated Dragons

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:59.270
that had gone through Resonance with humans.

00:17:59.270 --> 00:18:01.080
Are you sure, Jin?

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:04.240
It wouldn't make any sense to lie about it.

00:18:04.240 --> 00:18:07.920
Damn that Gio, he's just pulling
this so that at least he survives!

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:11.120
No! Gio wouldn't do something like that!

00:18:11.120 --> 00:18:14.180
Then why did he attack us?

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:22.500
I don't know...

00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:27.100
In any case, if he attacks,
we have to fight back.

00:18:27.100 --> 00:18:28.970
Is that agreed?

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:34.940
I'm going to go clear my head.

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:53.530
Toa's life will come to an end soon.

00:18:53.530 --> 00:18:57.870
Toa, I am the only one who can save you.

00:18:57.870 --> 00:19:00.490
Are you sure about that, Gio?!

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:08.310
I'm sorry.

00:19:10.010 --> 00:19:13.180
What can I do?

00:19:13.180 --> 00:19:16.820
I don't want to leave you, either, Jin.

00:19:16.820 --> 00:19:18.580
What do you mean?

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:23.380
What do you mean?

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:26.930
What are you hiding?

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:30.360
You're acting strange, Toa.
And so is Gio, and Jin.

00:19:30.360 --> 00:19:32.170
Where did those three people

00:19:32.170 --> 00:19:36.360
who were living so happily
in that tiny house go off to?!

00:19:37.910 --> 00:19:43.280
I'm sorry, Sigelinde. I...

00:19:43.280 --> 00:19:45.510
...am going to die soon.

00:19:48.950 --> 00:19:51.250
My life is nearing its end.

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:57.390
Gio realized it, which is
why he went to Thanatos.

00:19:57.390 --> 00:20:03.900
Thanatos is able to extend my life, you see.

00:20:03.900 --> 00:20:07.300
Does Jin know?

00:20:07.300 --> 00:20:12.640
I'm not sure. He may have heard from Gio.

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:17.140
Oh, no... Why didn't you say anything?

00:20:17.140 --> 00:20:21.480
I'm sorry. I couldn't say it.

00:20:21.480 --> 00:20:26.050
I didn't want to ruin the
peaceful life we were living.

00:20:26.050 --> 00:20:31.750
We were living our own
genuinely ideal lives there.

00:20:33.560 --> 00:20:38.730
Why? Why does it have to be like this?

00:20:38.730 --> 00:20:40.970
Sigelinde?

00:20:40.970 --> 00:20:47.270
I know I have a big mouth, but I was envious...

00:20:47.270 --> 00:20:51.350
I was envious of you guys...

00:20:51.350 --> 00:20:55.440
So now, why does it have to be like this?

00:21:06.130 --> 00:21:08.620
I have to do something.

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:13.500
I have to do something.

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:17.470
But what can I do?

00:21:17.470 --> 00:21:20.460
What can I do?

00:21:36.820 --> 00:21:38.810
It's better this way...

00:21:45.070 --> 00:21:47.300
It's better this way...

00:21:50.970 --> 00:21:54.030
...if it will save Toa.

00:22:19.570 --> 00:22:21.840
You don't even think hard about the meaning

00:22:21.840 --> 00:22:24.100
of the words you spit out

00:22:24.100 --> 00:22:28.440
you just run away from the present

00:22:28.440 --> 00:22:30.710
Still doing the same things over and over,

00:22:30.710 --> 00:22:32.850
like nothing has happened

00:22:32.850 --> 00:22:36.520
It makes no sense to run away again

00:22:36.520 --> 00:22:45.390
In the end, you're immature,
still a child, complacent

00:22:45.390 --> 00:22:54.800
Leave behind your old self already

00:22:54.800 --> 00:22:59.310
The righteous fight starts within you

00:22:59.310 --> 00:23:03.740
What would you do?
You're out of time, aren't you?

00:23:03.740 --> 00:23:08.820
Try to remember how you're supposed to be

00:23:08.820 --> 00:23:15.920
before it all falls apart

00:23:15.920 --> 00:23:22.050
Fight or flight

00:23:24.730 --> 00:23:29.500
Fight or flight

00:23:43.020 --> 00:23:45.850
Say, Saki-san, Ryoko-san, come look at these!

00:23:45.850 --> 00:23:49.520
Eh? These are the scripts for
Dragonaut from here on, aren't they?

00:23:49.520 --> 00:23:51.430
To think that things take this turn later...

00:23:51.430 --> 00:23:52.930
Yeah, isn't it incredible?

00:23:52.930 --> 00:23:57.000
Who'd have ever thought that
"beep" would "beep"? It's shocking!

00:23:57.000 --> 00:24:01.470
It really is more than I imagined.
I mean, "beep" and "beep"!

00:24:01.470 --> 00:24:04.000
Well, let's base the preview on this!

00:24:04.000 --> 00:24:06.810
Next time, "beep" "beeps"!

00:24:06.810 --> 00:24:09.470
No, you don't have to say "beep" there.
